        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 251FL, Classico Collection Ornate Egret Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAt first glance, the bird depicted on the Omnia's Classico Collection 251FL Door Lever might not be obvious, but that is what makes it such a special piece. It rewards those who are willing to look a little closer; and who wouldn't want a second look at this beautiful lever. The Imperial Egret Lever is made out of solid brass, but it looks dainty enough to fly away. We love the beautiful detailing from wing to beak and the gorgeous rosette as a backdrop enhances its loveliness. This bird door lever is available in 4 finishes, each of which are designed to highlight all the intricate details. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" thick doors with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-ornate-deadbolt-omnia-flordb\">Matching Single Cylinder Deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Imperial Egret Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 251 Egret Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>55 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Lever Functions are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia 251FL Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Imperial Egret Lever, Omnia 251FL",
                "description": "Omnia 251FL, Imperial Egret Lever - At first glance, the bird depicted on the Omnia's Classico Collection 251FL Door Lever might not be obvious, but that is what makes it such a special piece. It rewards those who are willing to look a little closer; and who wouldn't want a second look at this beautiful lever. The Imperial Egret Lever is made out of solid brass, but it looks dainty enough to fly away. We love the beautiful detailing from wing to beak and the gorgeous rosette as a backdrop enhances its loveliness. This bird door lever is available in 4 finishes, each of which are designed to highlight all the intricate details. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
